{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JDG","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"士师记","commonName":"士师记","title":"士师记","order":7,"numberOfChapters":21,"sha256":"de9d04b664d21d890bf6473ff6252458b988c85e6cc9ad776d235156dfad6dec","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JDG/1.json","lastChapterNumber":21,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JDG/21.json","totalNumberOfVerses":617},"chapter":{"number":17,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["米迦的偶像"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以法莲山地有一个人名叫米迦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他对母亲说：「你那一千一百舍客勒银子被人拿去，你因此咒诅，并且告诉了我。看哪，这银子在我这里，是我拿去了。」他母亲说：「我儿啊，愿耶和华赐福与你！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["米迦就把这一千一百舍客勒银子还他母亲。他母亲说：「我分出这银子来为你献给耶和华，好雕刻一个像，铸成一个像。现在我还是交给你。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["米迦将银子还他母亲，他母亲将二百舍客勒银子交给银匠，雕刻一个像，铸成一个像，安置在米迦的屋内。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["这米迦有了神堂，又制造以弗得和家中的神像，分派他一个儿子作祭司。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那时以色列中没有王，各人任意而行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["犹大的伯利恒有一个少年人，是犹大族的利未人，他在那里寄居。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["这人离开犹大的伯利恒城，要找一个可住的地方。行路的时候，到了以法莲山地，走到米迦的家。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["米迦问他说：「你从哪里来？」他回答说：「从犹大的伯利恒来。我是利未人，要找一个可住的地方。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["米迦说：「你可以住在我这里，我以你为父、为祭司。我每年给你十舍客勒银子，一套衣服和度日的食物。」利未人就进了他的家。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["利未人情愿与那人同住；那人看这少年人如自己的儿子一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["米迦分派这少年的利未人作祭司，他就住在米迦的家里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["米迦说：「现在我知道耶和华必赐福与我，因我有一个利未人作祭司。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JDG/17.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JDG/18.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/JDG/16.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}